Example data (CC0 1.0)
----------------------
The example images (ISIC_0000000, ISIC_0000013, ISIC_0001115) are public-domain (CC-0)
dermoscopic photographs from the International Skin Imaging Collaboration (ISIC) Archive
(https://www.isic-archive.com/), mirrored and commit-pinned on neurodeskorg/webapps.
